{"path":"utility/basic_stacktrace/end","title":"std::basic_stacktrace<Allocator>::end, std::basic_stacktrace<Allocator>::cend","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_stacktrace&lt;Allocator&gt;::</span>end, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_stacktrace&lt;Allocator&gt;::</span>cend","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace/end","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the iterator pointing past the last entry of the basic_stacktrace.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">const_iterator end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">const_iterator cend<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the iterator pointing past the last entry of the <code>basic_stacktrace</code>. \n</p><p>This iterator acts as a placeholder; attempting to dereference it results in undefined behavior. \n</p>\n<div class=\"t-image\">\n<p><img alt=\"range-begin-end.svg\" src=\"/cppreference/images/1/1b/range-begin-end.svg\" width=\"546\" height=\"157\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The end iterator.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stacktrace&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> trace       <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">stacktrace</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">current</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> empty_trace <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace\"><span class=\"kw3635\">std::<span class=\"me2\">stacktrace</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// Print stacktrace.</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/for_each\"><span class=\"kw1580\">std::<span class=\"me2\">for_each</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>trace.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, trace.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>,\n                  <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> f<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> f <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>empty_trace.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> empty_trace.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"stacktrace 'empty_trace' is indeed empty.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>0x0000000000402BA8 in ./prog.exe\n__libc_start_main in /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6\n0x0000000000402A29 in ./prog.exe\nstacktrace 'empty_trace' is indeed empty.</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace/begin\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>begin</span><span>cbegin</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns an iterator to the beginning <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/basic_stacktrace","title":"std::basic_stacktrace"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_stacktrace<Allocator>::end, std::basic_stacktrace<Allocator>::cend","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++23. Returns the iterator pointing past the last entry of the basic_stacktrace."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The end iterator